{"data":[{"date":"2021-01-10","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg"},"image":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/8b/00/277554_z999u.jpg","summary":"“我要在这个异世界拿出真本事！”\r\n34岁童贞且无职的家里蹲男子，在父母的葬礼当天被赶出家门后，在路上被一辆卡车所撞死。意识清醒后，他发现自己居然作为一个刚出生的婴儿转生到了剑与魔法的异世界！像废物一样活过了前世的男子，发誓要作为少年·鲁迪乌斯在异世界以认真的态度好好活下去！\r\n等待着鲁迪乌斯的是，与娇小魔术师、有着精灵长耳又很男孩子气的美少女、凶暴的傲娇大小姐以及其他性格各异的人们之间的邂逅，当然也还有残酷的冒险与战斗。\r\n新的人生就要开始了！“人生重来型”幻想冒险谭，在此开幕！","name":"無職転生 ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","name_cn":"无职转生～到了异世界就拿出真本事～","tags":[{"name":"异世界","count":8046,"total_count":274323},{"name":"轻小说改","count":5412,"total_count":509980},{"name":"后宫","count":3324,"total_count":311767},{"name":"2021年1月","count":3178,"total_count":31997},{"name":"奇幻","count":3114,"total_count":492825},{"name":"穿越","count":2992,"total_count":65954},{"name":"TV","count":2573,"total_count":1446046},{"name":"StudioBind","count":2521,"total_count":16363},{"name":"战斗","count":1902,"total_count":490329},{"name":"轻改","count":1465,"total_count":155977},{"name":"2021","count":1344,"total_count":80473},{"name":"冒险","count":1114,"total_count":57151},{"name":"岡本学","count":944,"total_count":1319},{"name":"小说改","count":844,"total_count":168056},{"name":"日本","count":513,"total_count":314888},{"name":"无职转生","count":181,"total_count":5446},{"name":"日本动画","count":179,"total_count":36060},{"name":"冈本学","count":174,"total_count":2377},{"name":"成长","count":80,"total_count":5734},{"name":"恋爱","count":76,"total_count":584137},{"name":"转生","count":70,"total_count":5900},{"name":"神作","count":57,"total_count":48381},{"name":"2021年","count":45,"total_count":3685},{"name":"2020年1月","count":33,"total_count":25355},{"name":"热血","count":33,"total_count":218890},{"name